# Bumrungrad International Hospital

> Multi-specialty quaternary care hospital in Bangkok, Thailand, founded in 1980. JCI-accredited since 2002 (first in Southeast Asia).

## Core Pages

- [English Homepage](https://www.bumrungrad.com/en): Main site for international patients
- [Find a Doctor](https://www.bumrungrad.com/en/doctors): Search 1,200+ physicians by specialty, subspecialty, and language
- [Book an Appointment](https://www.bumrungrad.com/en/book-appointment): Online appointment scheduling (advance booking recommended)
- [Medical Centers & Clinics](https://www.bumrungrad.com/en/clinics-and-centers): Index of 60+ specialized centers
- [Packages and Promotions](https://www.bumrungrad.com/en/packages): Health check-up and screening packages with pricing
- [Contact Us](https://www.bumrungrad.com/en/contact-us/contact-details): Enquiries, hospital map, emergency hotline

## International Patients

- [Insurance Partners](https://www.bumrungrad.com/en/insurance): Contracted insurers and TPAs, cashless hospitalization guidelines
- [International Patient Services](https://www.bumrungrad.com/en/insurance-information-guides): Coordination, embassy liaison, language assistance
- [Medical Travel Guides](https://www.bumrungrad.com/en/medical-travel): Planning guide for overseas patients

## Affiliated Platforms

- [Vitallife Wellness Center](https://www.vitallifeintegratedhealth.com): Preventive and anti-aging care
- [Esperance Clinic](https://www.bumrungrad.com/th/centers/esperance-integrative-cancer-clinic): Integrative cancer care
- [Bumrungrad Telehealth](https://telehealth.bumrungrad.com): Virtual consultations

## Localization

- [Thai Homepage](https://www.bumrungrad.com/th): Main site in Thai for domestic services

## See Also
- [llms-full.txt](https://www.bumrungrad.com/llms-full.txt): Full documentation containing expanded medical technologies, clinical focus areas, operational guidelines, complete accreditation data, and the full list of alternative-language homepage gateways (Arabic, Chinese, Japanese, Russian, and more).